n internet platforms."},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patter.2025.101397_bib7","series-title":"The Twelfth International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR 2024)","first-page":"34590","article-title":"WildChat: 1M ChatGPT interaction logs in the wild","author":"Zhao","year":"2024"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patter.2025.101397_bib8","article-title":"Scaling synthetic data creation with 1,000,000,000 personas","author":"Ge","year":"2024","journal-title":"arXiv"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patter.2025.101397_bib9","series-title":"Proceedings of the 56th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (Volume 1: Long Papers)","first-page":"2204","article-title":"Personalizing dialogue agents: I have a dog, do you have pets too?","author":"Zhang","year":"2018"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patter.2025.101397_bib10","series-title":"International Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR) 2021","article-title":"Aligning AI with shared human values","author":"Hendrycks","year":"2021"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patter.2025.101397_bib11","article-title":"Holistic evaluation of language models","author":"Liang","year":"2023","journal-title":"Transactions on Machine Learning Research"},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patter.2025.101397_bib12","unstructured":"Wang, A., Ho, D.E., and Koyejo, S. (2025) Datasets and supplementary material for \u201cThe Inadequacy of Offline LLM Evaluations: A Need to Account for Personalization in Model Behavior\u201d. OSF, https:\/\/doi.org\/10.17605\/OSF.IO\/GRSCA."},{"key":"10.1016\/j.patter.2025.101397_bib13","series-title":"Proceedings of the 2025 Conference of the Nations of the Americas Chapter of the Association for Computational Linguistics: Human Language Technologies (Volume 3: Industry Track)","first-page":"809","article-title":"LLM safety for children","author":"Rath","year":"2025"}],"container-title":["Patterns"],"language":"en","link":[{"URL":"https:\/\/api.elsevier.com\/content\/article\/PII:S2666389925002454?httpAccept=text\/xml","content-type":"text\/xml","